doc-reader (文阅)

DOCX parsing, layout and PDF export use selected WordCraft crates.
WordCraft: https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft
Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the WordCraft contributors
MIT OR Apache-2.0. The source is pinned as vendor/wordcraft.

PDF serialization uses craft-pdf and Krilla from storytold/craft-libs.
https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs
The pinned upstream Krilla patch is retained by native/Cargo.toml.

PDF outlines are read with hayro-syntax (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
https://github.com/LaurenzV/hayro

Toolbar icons are adapted from IconPark, by ByteDance and its contributors.
https://github.com/bytedance/IconPark
Apache-2.0. Source SVGs, the license and adaptation notes are retained in
third_party/iconpark. Colors, strokes and selected fills were modified.

Noto Sans CJK SC Regular is copied unmodified from craft-fonts aced413.
Font upstream: https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1, native/mobile-fonts/OFL.txt.

Full third-party notices, including WordCraft's bundled font notices, ship in
app/src/main/assets/open-source-licenses.txt inside the APK and in this repository.

The app icon and the sample document are original to this project.
No WordCraft brand artwork or desktop interface is included.
